stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> unavailable: rollout denied or provider incomplete
  [*] --> starting: account admitted and provider ready
  starting --> awaiting_code: Twilio accepts the SMS
  starting --> delivery_unknown: request times out or process deadline passes
  starting --> delivery_failed: Twilio rejects the request
  awaiting_code --> awaiting_code: wrong code with attempts left
  awaiting_code --> verified: Twilio approves the code
  awaiting_code --> expired: local or Twilio expiry
  awaiting_code --> attempts_exhausted: local or Twilio attempt limit
  awaiting_code --> delivery_failed: canceled, deleted, or failed at Twilio
  delivery_unknown --> verified: Twilio approves an accepted code
  delivery_unknown --> awaiting_code: resend after 60 seconds
  delivery_unknown --> expired: challenge lifetime ends
  delivery_failed --> starting: request a new code
  expired --> starting: request a new code
  attempts_exhausted --> starting: request a new code
  verified --> [*]
